383
00:21:58,811 --> 00:22:00,504
Hey, sorry--I--

384
00:22:00,552 --> 00:22:03,681
No, it's okay.
It's fine. I just...

385
00:22:03,729 --> 00:22:05,074
Maybe, um...

386
